section#services.section.container(aria-labelledby="services-title")
  +section-heading("services-title", "What do we do")
    | We are a small team of designers and makers who help brands look their best online and offline.

  ul.services
    each service in services
      li.service
        span.service__icon(aria-hidden="true")
          +icon(service.icon, 40)
        h3.service__title #{ service.title }
        p.service__text #{ service.text }
